#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""DeskBridge - guided keyboard/mouse/clipboard sharing over Deskflow.

Product layer (MIT) over the unmodified Deskflow 1.27.0 engine
(GPL-2.0-only with LicenseRef-OpenSSL-Exception, https://deskflow.org).

DeskBridge ships no engine code. It guides setup (role, peer discovery,
screen placement, TLS pairing, firewall scoping), supervises the engine
(systemd-run --user on Linux), keeps state in deskbridge.json, and offers
status/diagnose/repair plus a local web UI.

License: MIT (this file and this repo's product code only).
"""

